  "name": "Ice Nova",
  "type": "spell",
  "img": "icons/svg/daze.svg",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Frigid cold rapidly expands in a 15-foot-radius centered on a point you you can see within range. Each creature in the cold must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save, a creature takes 10d6 cold damage and is restrained for 1 minute as ice encases the lower part of their legs. On a successful save, it takes half as much damage and isn't restrained by this spell.</p><p>A creature restrained by the ice can use its action to make a Strength check against your spell save DC. On a success, it frees itself. Alternatively, the ice can be broken by dealing a total of 40 hit points worth of damage to it. It has an armor class of 10.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
